<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Mackie shrs temporarily suspended.</title>
<headline>Mackie shrs temporarily suspended.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Mackie International Group Plc were suspended from 0730 local time (0630 GMT) on Monday at the company's request.</p>
<p>The suspension was made pending clarification of the preliminary results announced on March 26, a statement from the company said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
